text = "








[color=#ff1c18]A FEW LAST WORDS[/color]...

[color=#ffffff]-[/color] Even though we've shown you the basics, we've already told you [color=#ff8864]way too much[/color]. In this game, it's just like in [color=#ff8864]NEW-CAELUM[/color]: [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff1c18]figure it out yourself[/color][/shake]! Learn how things work around here the hard way. Life doesn't cut you any slack, and [color=#ff8864]neither will we[/color]. Besides, [color=#ff1c18]the fun is [color=#ff8864]also[/color] in the challenge of it all[/color]!


[color=#ff8864]D.B.[/color]"
